# Alpha OS — X11 display server — Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute)
# Provenance: names verified as exact matches against the resolute
# binary-amd64 Packages indexes on archive.ubuntu.com (released 23 Apr 2026).
#
# Alpha OS is dual-stack: this file provides the Xorg server used by the
# Cinnamon, Plasma (plasmax11.desktop) and XFCE (xfce.desktop) sessions, and
# by XWayland for the GNOME/Plasma Wayland sessions.
# `librsvg2-bin` is required by the `live-build` syslinux boot theme.
# Note `libgl1-mesa-glx` is gone in resolute; `libglvnd` + `libglx-mesa0`
# cover it.

xorg
xserver-xorg
xserver-xorg-core
xserver-xorg-video-all
xserver-xorg-input-all
xserver-xorg-input-libinput
xserver-xorg-input-evdev
xserver-xorg-input-synaptics
x11-utils
x11-apps
x11-xserver-utils
x11-session-utils
xinit
xauth
xfonts-base
xfonts-100dpi
xfonts-75dpi
xfonts-terminus
xfonts-utils
xwayland
libgl1-mesa-dri
libglx-mesa0
dbus-x11
librsvg2-bin
